cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this plugin marketplace, please cite it."
title: "claude-plugins: Hermes Labs Plugin Marketplace for Claude Code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bosch Rodriguez"
    given-names: "Rolando"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4896-1112"
    affiliation: "Hermes Labs"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hermes-labs-ai/claude-plugins"
abstract: >
  claude-plugins is the Hermes Labs plugin marketplace manifest for Claude
  Code, added with `/plugin marketplace add hermes-labs-ai/claude-plugins`.
  It is a marketplace/metadata repository, not a standalone software tool:
  it declares and points to seven separately maintained Hermes Labs plugins
  (hermes-blind, lintlang, rule-audit, hermeneutic-gate, little-canary,
  claude-trash-guard, agent-signage) via a validated marketplace.json, so
  that Claude Code can discover and install them.
keywords:
  - "Claude Code"
  - "plugin marketplace"
  - "AI agent tooling"
  - "developer tools"
